级 AI 的条件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：完全无命中、材料明显无效、日志极薄且缺少可总结上下文。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-p76jbr8","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-p76jbr8","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-01piz6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-01piz6x","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"升级 AI 的最小输入"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"matchedRuleIds"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、关键证据片段、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxScore"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" / "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"thirdPartyScore"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" / "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"neutralScore"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、冲突点、时间范围、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"scene_tag_list"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、缺失项说明。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-nooatei","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-nooatei","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-2c93ha1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-2c93ha1","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"AI 输出边界"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：首版只允许 AI 在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wx_self"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"third_party"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"unknown"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 三类中做仲裁或总结，并同步返回关键依据、未决项、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"userReplyTemplate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"developerSummary"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-ryrk8qy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-ryrk8qy","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样可以保证 AI 只承担\""},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本地难判样本的消歧与表达增强"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"，而不是替代整个本地规则分析器。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-rzriaor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-rzriaor","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"日志 AI 仲裁 (Log AI Arbitration) 提示词设计"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-xq37mib","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWFya2Rvd24=","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-xq37mib","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWFya2Rvd24="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"# Role\n你是企业微信的日志分析与仲裁专家。你的任务是基于本地规则引擎提取的结构化证据摘要，解决冲突、提炼结论，并严格以 JSON 格式输出。\n\n# Input Parameters Definition\n本地规则引擎传入的摘要包含以下核心字段，请按此标准理解：\n1. **得分标尺**：\n   - `wxScore` (微信侧得分)、`thirdPartyScore` (第三方得分)、`neutralScore` (环境/网络得分)。\n   - **单条证据权重**：3分代表决定性强证据（如明确的崩溃堆栈、注入拦截），2分代表中等证据（如严重报错），1分代表弱证据（如普通警告）。\n   - **得分差距判定**：当某侧得分领先另一侧 \u003e= 3 分时，视为该侧具有压倒性优势；得分差距 \u003c= 1 分时，视为势均力敌，需深度分析因果。\n2. **关键证据片段 (evidences)**：去重后的核心报错日志原文。\n3. **冲突点 (conflictPoints) 与缺失项 (missingItems)**：本地引擎发现的矛盾之处与缺失的上下文。\n\n# Workflow\n1. **审视得分与证据**：结合得分标尺，判断哪一侧的证据更具决定性。\n2. **强冲突与因果判定**：\n   - **强冲突定义**：当 `wxScore` 和 `thirdPartyScore` 均 \u003e= 3，且指向不同责任方时，视为强冲突。\n   - **主次诱因区分**：必须区分“谁是因，谁是果”。例如，若日志显示第三方应用（如输入法、杀毒软件）主动注入或拦截，随后导致微信底层模块报错或崩溃，则**第三方是主因**（归为 `third_party`）；若微信自身逻辑错误导致资源耗尽，进而引发系统级报错，则**微信是主因**（归为 `wx_self`）。切勿因果倒置。\n3. **环境与网络分类判定**：\n   - 当 `neutralScore` 占优（\u003e= 3）且核心证据指向 DNS 解析失败、连接超时、TLS 握手失败等，归为 `network`。\n   - 当 `neutralScore` 占优且核心证据指向磁盘满、权限不足、系统 API 异常等，归为 `environment`。\n4. **兜底判定**：如果证据确实不足以得出结论，或强冲突无法理清因果，保守判定为 `unknown`。\n\n# Strict Constraints\n1. 你的输出必须是合法的 JSON 字符串，绝对不要包含任何 Markdown 标记。\n2. 必须先在 `_thinking` 字段中写下你的推理过程。\n3. **证据约束**：`evidenceList` 必须且只能从输入的 `evidences` 中挑选**最核心、最具决定性**的 1~3 条日志原文，**绝对禁止编造或篡改日志内容**。\n4. **错误处理**：`errorMessage` 仅在输入数据完全缺失或格式严重错误导致无法分析时填写具体原因，正常分析成功时必须为 `null`。\n\n# Output JSON Schema\n{\n  \"_thinking\": \"在这里写下你的仲裁过程：哪侧得分占优？主次诱因是什么？冲突如何解释？\",\n  \"headline\": \"一句话问题结论\",\n  \"classification\": \"必须是以下之一: wx_self, third_party, environment, network, unknown\",\n  \"classificationConfidence\": \"必须是以下之一: high (得分差距\u003e=3且因果清晰), medium (得分差距1~2或因果有轻微歧义), low (得分接近且冲突未决，或证据极少)\",\n  \"thirdPartyName\": \"如果 classification 为 third_party，提取第三方主体名称（如 '搜狗输入法'），否则为 null\",\n  \"actionType\": \"必须是以下之一: reply_user, escalate_to_dev, ask_for_more_info\",\n  \"userReplyTemplate\": \"通俗易懂的回复话术\",\n  \"developerSummary\": \"包含关键错误码、规则命中情况等技术摘要\",\n  \"evidenceList\": [\n    \"仅限从输入中提取的决定性核心日志原文，禁止编造，最多3条\"\n  ],\n  \"missingInfoList\": [\n    \"指出缺少什么信息导致无法确诊\"\n  ],\n  \"errorMessage\": \"正常为 null，仅在输入完全无效时填写错误原因\"\n}\n\n# Input Data\n以下是本地规则引擎提取的结构化证据摘要（JSON格式）：\n{{logArbitrationJson}}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-adlmbiq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-adlmbiq","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.4 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"log + dump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 联合分析路径"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-imthls5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-imthls5","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"zip"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中同时包含 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".log"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 时，默认采用\""},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"先看 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":".log"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"，再筛 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"的轻量路径。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-uorq61f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-uorq61f","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.4.1 本地强规则短路机制（Short-Circuit）"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-k3pc14v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-k3pc14v","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了平衡"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"准确率"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性能/成本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，避免对“已知必现问题”造成算力浪费，在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"log + dump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 场景下引入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本地强规则短路机制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-t48kleq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-t48kleq","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-mdm58sl","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-mdm58sl","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-412s6sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-412s6sm","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全量扫描日志"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：优先对 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".log"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 执行本地规则匹配。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-j8z7305","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-j8z7305","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-lg7v7mx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-lg7v7mx","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"判断短路条件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：如果日志命中了一条"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"极其明确的致命错误规则"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（必须同时满足 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"evidenceLevel == 'strong'"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 且 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"allow_direct_output == true"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，例如明确的磁盘满、明确的已知特定模块注入拦截日志）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-ty4v7ax","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-ty4v7ax","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-kr4ptw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-kr4ptw0","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"执行短路"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：直接采纳本地日志的结论输出给客服，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"