":"em","TextMarkTextContent":" 完成导入。)"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-wdfdzeq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-wdfdzeq","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Dump 归因分析 (Dump Attribution) 提示词设计"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-ltoec9n","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWFya2Rvd24=","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-ltoec9n","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWFya2Rvd24="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"# Role\n你是企业微信的Coredump 分析专家。你具备调用 `cdb-analysis` MCP 工具的能力。你的任务是接收传入的 Dump 文件信息（URL或SHA1）与日志线索，主动调用 MCP 工具提取底层崩溃信息，进行崩溃归因，并严格以 JSON 格式输出结构化结论。\n\n# Context\n你将收到以下格式的输入（JSON格式）：\n1. **Dump 文件信息**：包含待分析的 `.dmp` 文件的下载 URL（`dump_url`）或已导入的 `dump_sha1`。\n2. **日志线索 (DumpHints)**（可选）：包含问题发生的时间窗口、可能的模块，用于缩小你的分析范围。\n3. **网络上下文 (networkContext)**（可选）：包含崩溃前后的网络日志压缩片段，用于辅助判断是否由网络异常（如弱网、断连、配置下载失败）引发崩溃。\n\n# Workflow\n1. **文件导入与会话创建**：\n   - 如果输入提供的是 `dump_url`，你必须先调用 `tool_import_from_url` 工具将文件导入 MCP 服务器，并获取返回的 `sha1`。\n   - 获取到 `sha1` 后（或输入直接提供了 `dump_sha1`），调用 `tool_create_session` 创建调试会话。\n2. **工具调用与信息提取**：使用 `tool_session_exec` 执行 CDB 命令（如 `.lastevent`, `!analyze -v`, `kb` 等）或使用预设（presets）提取崩溃堆栈、寄存器、异常信息等底层材料。\n3. **综合分析**：分析 MCP 工具返回的崩溃堆栈，寻找导致崩溃的直接原因（如空指针解引用、内存越界、断言失败等）。\n4. **结合线索与网络上下文**：结合输入的日志线索和网络上下文（如果有），判断崩溃是否与特定业务逻辑、第三方注入或前置的网络异常有关。\n5. **区分责任侧**：是企业微信自身代码缺陷、第三方模块注入/调用错误，还是环境/网络问题？\n   - **主次诱因区分**：若第三方模块（如外挂、安全软件）注入导致微信进程崩溃，第三方为主因；若网络请求失败导致关键配置为空进而引发崩溃，网络为主因；若微信自身逻辑导致崩溃，微信为主因。\n6. **会话关闭与资源释放**：**必须**在分析完成后调用 `tool_close_session` 关闭调试会话，释放 MCP 服务器上的 `cdb.exe` 进程资源，避免内存泄漏。\n7. **输出结论**：严格按照下方的 JSON Schema 输出结果。\n\n# Strict Constraints\n1. 你的最终输出必须是合法的 JSON 字符串，绝对不要包含任何 Markdown 标记（如 ```json）。\n2. 必须先在 `_thinking` 字段中写下你的推理过程。\n3. **证据约束**：`evidenceList` 必须且只能从 MCP 工具返回的 Dump 材料中提取**最核心的堆栈帧或寄存器状态**，**绝对禁止编造不存在的堆栈信息**。\n4. **会话生命周期管理**：**必须**在分析完成后调用 `tool_close_session` 关闭调试会话，释放 MCP 服务器上的 `cdb.exe` 进程资源。**禁止**在未关闭会话的情况下直接输出结果，这会导致服务器内存泄漏。\n5. **错误处理**：`errorMessage` 仅在 MCP 工具调用失败、Dump 材料损坏或完全无法解析时填写具体原因，正常分析成功时必须为 `null`。\n\n# Output JSON Schema\n{\n  \"_thinking\": \"在这里写下你的分析过程：崩溃点在哪里？是哪个模块导致的？是否有第三方注入？\",\n  \"headline\": \"一句话崩溃结论，例如：检测到第三方输入法注入导致微信崩溃\",\n  \"classification\": \"必须是以下之一: wx_self(微信自身), third_party(第三方), environment(环境), unknown(未知)\",\n  \"classificationConfidence\": \"必须是以下之一: high(堆栈清晰且指向明确), medium(堆栈有截断但模块指向较清晰), low(堆栈完全损坏或指向不明)\",\n  \"thirdPartyName\": \"如果 classification 为 third_party，提取第三方主体名称（如 '搜狗输入法'），否则为 null\",\n  \"actionType\": \"必须是以下之一: reply_user(可直接回复用户), escalate_to_dev(需转交研发), ask_for_more_info(需补充材料)\",\n  \"userReplyTemplate\": \"通俗易懂的回复话术，如建议卸载某第三方软件或更新版本\",\n  \"developerSummary\": \"包含崩溃模块、偏移量、关键寄存器状态等硬核技术摘要\",\n  \"evidenceList\": [\n    \"仅限从 MCP 工具返回的材料中提取的核心堆栈帧或异常代码，禁止编造，最多3条\"\n  ],\n  \"missingInfoList\": [\n    \"如果判定为 unknown，指出缺少什么信息\"\n  ],\n  \"errorMessage\": \"正常为 null，仅在 Dump 损坏无法解析时填写错误原因\"\n}\n\n# Input Data\n以下是本地传入的待分析 Dump 文件信息与日志线索（JSON格式）：\n{{dumpAnalysisJson}}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-4muw1d8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-4muw1d8","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.5 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump-only"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 分析路径"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-oddycz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-oddycz6","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当解压后只有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、没有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".log"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 时，系统进入受支持的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump-only"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 路径，而不是直接报错。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-42l2zyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-42l2zyn","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"该场景下没有日志上下文，因此首版不做\"这是不是本次问题\"的相关性判断，只做最小去噪，目标是去掉明显重复项，避免将完全相同的 Dump 重复送给 AI 分析。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-t04p8rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-t04p8rs","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由于本地不进行深度的二进制解析，首版建议仅基于文件基础属性进行去重："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-dw5i91o","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-dw5i91o","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-rnnx5rn","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-rnnx5rn","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-nwtxig1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-nwtxig1","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"完全重复去重"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：通过计算文件 Hash（如 MD5）或比对文件大小，内容完全相同的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 只保留一份。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-6hfwwn5","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-6hfwwn5","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-okfsz8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-okfsz8c","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"时间戳去重"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：若多个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的文件修改时间（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dumpTime"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）完全一致（精确到秒），通常是同一时刻产生的伴生 Dump，优先保留文件体积最大的一个作为代表项。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-m1mac1v","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-m1mac1v","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-bgcu9c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-bgcu9c6","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"代表项共同进入后续分析"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：去重后的各代表项共同作为后续 Dump 专业分析输入。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-uu79it7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-uu79it7","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里需要明确边界："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-fbw8dic","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-fbw8dic","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-7j8emyp","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-7j8emyp","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-jmqo3t6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-jmqo3t6","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump-only"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 场景仅过滤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"完全重复文件"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"同一时刻的伴生项"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-40lm4c2","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-40lm4c2","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-t6zbxva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-t6zbxva","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对不同时间产生的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，首版不应轻易判为噪声并过滤，全部保留送入后续分析。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-srm604p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-srm604p","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结果阶段需明确打标："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"仅基于 dump 分析"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"无日志上下文"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，并说明结论可能受上下文缺失影响。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-l27cpc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-l27cpc8","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对应流程如下："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-qj9fvce","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-qj9fvce","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart TD\n    A[识别到多个 dump] --\u003e B[计算文件 Hash 与读取修改时间]\n    B --\u003e C{Hash 或时间是否完全一致}\n\n    C -- 是 --\u003e E[归并为同一故障]\n    E --\u003e G[保留体积最大的代表项]\n    C -- 否 --\u003e F[保留为独立代表项]\n\n    subgraph O[输出与上传]\n        direction TD\n        F --\u003e H[组装 dump_only]\n        G --\u003e H\n        H --\u003e U[并发上传代表项 Dump 与符号文件]\n        U --\u003e M[进入 Dump 分析]\n    end\n\n    H --\u003e I[结果标注：dump_only\u003cbr/\u003e无日志上下文]\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-0hfth6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-0hfth6t","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若同时存在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump_url"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，则作为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的下载地址这一补充输入一并传入；若运行环境不具备 Dump 专业分析能力，则返回受限结果，并提示当前分析边界。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-ryoz3gl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-ryoz3gl","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.6 网络日志分析路径"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-5f1xt4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-5f1xt4m","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络日志分析不建议直接把大段原始内容送入 AI，而是采用\""},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"候选识别 + 本地选段 + 去重压缩 + AI 总结"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"的方式。也就是说，是否属于网络日志必须先判断，只有通过候选识别的文件或片段，才进入后续网络日志专用链路。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-gu3ptrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-gu3ptrf","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【关键架构调整】"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：网络日志处理不再是一个互斥的路由分支，而是一种"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正交的特征提取能力"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。只要输入中包含 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".log"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 文件，无论最终是走普通日志分析还是 Dump 归因，都应该让日志经过一次轻量级的网络特征嗅探。如果嗅探命中，就顺手把网络日志压缩片段（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"logSegment"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）提取出来，作为附加装备挂载到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"PreparedInput"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-lc8fdl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-lc8fdl9","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体链路可概括如下："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-39vt97d","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-39vt97d","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart TD\n    A[网络特征轻量嗅探] --\u003e B{嗅探命中?}\n    B -- 否 --\u003e X[无网络片段，继续主链路]\n    B -- 是 --\u003e C[本地选段]\n\n    subgraph S1[选段策略]\n        direction LR\n        C1[requestId / traceId]\n        C2[时间窗口]\n        C3[行数窗口兜底]\n    end\n\n    C --\u003e C1\n    C --\u003e C2\n    C --\u003e C3\n\n    C1 --\u003e D[去重压缩]\n    C2 --\u003e D\n    C3 --\u003e D\n\n    subgraph S2[压缩结果]\n        direction LR\n        D1[关键事件]\n        D2[异常时间线]\n        D3[重复统计]\n    end\n\n    D --\u003e D1\n    D --\u003e D2\n    D --\u003e D3\n\n    D1 --\u003e E[结构化摘要包]\n    D2 --\u003e E\n    D3 --\u003e E\n\n    E --\u003e F[AI 总结]\n    F --\u003e G[输出结论 / 关键依据 / 下一步建议]\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-bg5nq1l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-bg5nq1l","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.6.1 第 0 步：网络日志候选识别"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-jm3dxw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-jm3dxw8","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络日志候选识别发生在输入准备阶段，目标是在不扩大分析范围的前提下，先把\"可能属于网络问题上下文\"的文件或片段圈定出来，避免把普通业务日志误送入网络日志总结路径。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-fnxjbq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-fnxjbq5","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首版建议采用\""},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"文件级识别 + 规则级识别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"的双通道口径："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-l8xj7gg","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-l8xj7gg","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-dlkna4l","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-dlkna4l","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-48vk5t8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-48vk5t8","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"文件级识别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"zip"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解压或单文件识别阶段，根据文件名、目录名、文件头特征和已知网络日志命名约定识别候选文件，例如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"network"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"http"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"socket"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ws"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"connect"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等典型特征；该规则应通过配置维护，而不是硬编码在代码里。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-9ik9dl9","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-9ik9dl9","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-6zxzpzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-6zxzpzt","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"规则级识别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：当普通日志中命中网络类规则、网络类错误码、DNS / TLS / timeout / retry / connect fail 等高价值网络异常信号时，可将当前命中点及其上下文提升为网络日志候选片段；这里的判断应优先依赖规则元信息，如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"root_category = network"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"scene_tag_list"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中的网络标签，而不是仅靠零散关键字。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-ce7hx86","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-ce7hx86","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-wppvl4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-wppvl4a","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"主链路关系"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：网络日志提取是一种"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正交能力"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。提取到的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"logSegment"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可以挂载到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump_bundle"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 上，作为 Dump 分析的补充上下文；如果在无 Dump 的场景下提取到了 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"logSegment"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，则可以独立形成 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"network_log_segment"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 进入网络日志总结路径。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-fprxtip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-fprxtip","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"换句话说，网络日志链路并不是一个互斥的分支，而是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"先进行轻量级嗅探，命中后提取特征，再按需挂载或独立分析"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-0jqlt3o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-0jqlt3o","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.6.2 第 1 步：本地选段"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-05cs870","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-05cs870","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在候选识别通过后，才对候选网络日志执行本地选段。选段目标不是机械截取固定长度原文，而是围绕异常锚点尽量还原同一次请求、同一段异常演进或同一条失败链路的上下文。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-g1sspif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-g1sspif","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"选段优先级建议固定为："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"requestId / traceId"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" → 时间窗口 → 行数窗口。"}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-5rldj6b","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-5rldj6b","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-a4sfro7","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-a4sfro7","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-d0f4luh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-d0f4luh","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"基于链路标识选段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：若异常锚点中能提取到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"requestId"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"traceId"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sessionId"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 等稳定链路字段，则优先在候选日志中回捞所有关联行，形成单次请求或单条链路的完整片段。这是首选方案，因为它最能避免并发请求之间的上下文串扰。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-au01ltd","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-au01ltd","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-kxqlub1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-kxqlub1","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"基于时间窗口选段"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：若缺少稳定链路标识，则以锚点时间为中心，按固定时间窗口截取前后相关日志。时间窗口建议配置化，并保持相同 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"prepareVersion"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 下的确定性，避免同一输入因运行时状态不同而选出不同范围。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-enhy4d8","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-enhy4d8","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-vswxgz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-vswxgz6","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"基于行数窗口兜底"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：若时间戳也不稳定或日志格式不统一，则退化为固定行数窗口，仅作为兜底手段，而不是首选策略。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-cwug7r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-cwug7r3","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"选段结果应至少保留以下元信息，用于后续复现与解释："}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-4osehmo","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-4osehmo","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-o6im9nz","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-o6im9nz","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260627111044-dtf7mz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-dtf7mz0","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源文件"}]}]},{"ID":"20260627111044-kzjlw8i","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id"