容易偏题 | 先做候选识别，再本地选段、去重压缩并构造结构化摘要包 |\n| 规则库覆盖不足 | 初期规则难以覆盖环境类、第三方类复杂问题 | 按分类逐步补齐，通过人工维护规则库提升覆盖 |\n| 多 Dump 选择 | 一个 `zip` 中可能包含多个 `.dmp`，且混有历史噪声或重复 Dump | `log + dump` 场景先按保留 / 过滤两类筛选；`dump-only` 场景先去重、同签名归并，再保留各故障家族代表项进入后续分析 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260627111044-082mw66","updated":"20260627111044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"评估项"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风险说明"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应对措施"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归因误判"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"企业微信自身问题与第三方问题边界不清，易造成误判"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"建立分类规则、证据与反证机制，保留 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"unknown"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 结果"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Dump 上下文不足"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仅有 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 无 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".log"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 时，结论稳定性下降"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"引入 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"dump-only"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 路径，并明确展示上下文边界"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP 可用性"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"cdb-analysis MCP"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 不可用将影响 Dump 专业分析深度"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","